      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7d195944726c428eb208937b7bf7a5ac_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There is also no merit in the contention of the respondent that the Authorities have taken into consideration the parameters laid down in 2013 Act while declaring the vacancies on 30.01.2014."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2c45222783684746a0c991494212e92b_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There is nothing on record to suggest that when the vacancies were declared on 30.01.2014, the Authorities kept in mind the provision of the 2013 Act."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "716e6e685f5c4da28306f5fb26079790_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The 2013 Act came into effect on 10.09.2013."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "554555c45f164f3a9a170a768eeb25c5_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThe vacancy notice is dated 30.01.2014."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "1639398f09514f8db5fa7b03e57732da_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The vacancy notice does not refer to the provisions of 2013 Act."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "42fb240817d74c3298628c6af22fda47_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In our view, it would be improper to infer that the provisions of 2013 Act were kept in mind while issuing vacancy notice dated 30.01.2014."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3dfbea9d39c24d88ba4b17d08b0ed066_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The respondent has not made out a case of arbitrariness or unreasonableness or mala fide."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a9c8eca2d46c45bb8c3f4366ddc74b0d_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In our view, the Division Bench ought to have held that the notification dated 17.08.2015 was issued to keep the public distribution system in tune with the mandate of 2013 Act, more specifically Section 12 which provides for reform in the "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "beeedc79f4594318a92a804dd2176adb_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nLailur Rahaman vs The State Of West Bengal & Ors on 30 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/189997736/\n4"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3733b5f55bd8462b8a49f0c8a4bd4856_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Having heard the parties and having considered the observations of the Hon'ble Apex Court, it is true that the present petitioner has acted on the promise of the State authority."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ae462a9405cf45edabcc13693cfa1077_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, the State authority is duty-bound under Section 12 of the National Food Safety Act, 2013 to rescind all earlier vacancy notifications."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c44c4b73be164b9bb92502fd8d2f21c2_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Thus, the act and action of the State authority was affirmed by the Hon'ble Supreme Court."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f4470da757a54137b9b528b1159d37bc_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the present case, it is true that the petitioner has acted on the promise of the State authority and the performance on such assurance, he has incurred a huge sum of money."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "eedb80511ea54332bc07b3afce7e2b4c_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The claim of damages against the State may very well lie by the petitioner in appropriate proceeding."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "92a42d65d6dd47668ece4cabf63eeeb5_45",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nHowever, in considering the entire materials in the present writ petition and the prayers thereof, it appears to me that the instant writ petition has got no merit at all after decision of Hon'ble Apex Court mentioned above, thus, the same"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4cda8515b4e84a4996c684bcb2ec4472_46",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nUrgent certified photostat copy of this order, if applied for, shall be given to the parties as expeditiously as possible on compliance with all the necessary formalities."
      }
